  8	//!
  9	//! # State Machine
 10	//!
 11	//! ```text
 12	//! Init → Answering ──→ DialingAgents ──→ Connected → Done
 13	//!           │                │
 14	//!           │                ├─ Busy/NoAnswer → Retry/Fallback
 15	//!           │                │
 16	//!           └─ HoldMusic ◄───┘ (while waiting)
 17	//! ```
